<title>CANADA: Imperial Oil raises posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Imperial Oil raises posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Oil Ltd said it raised the price it would pay for Edmonton light sweet crude oil by C$8.00/cubic metre or C$1.27/barrel, to C$216.00/cubic metre or C$34.34/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Other new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$209.00/cubic metre, or C$33.23/barrel</p>
<p>Bow River at Hardisty C$177.00/cubic metre, or C$28.14/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$183.00/cubic metre, or C$29.09/barrel</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
